###################################################
# PC NAS
###################################################
scrape-bazos.exe search \
    --category pc --sub-category 'pc' \
    --keyword 'nas' \
    --details-all

Analyze data in attached json file
 * If price field does not have value, check 'full_description' field and parse value e.g. Cena 27 €.
 * provide list of NAS solutions items worth of money
   and provide reason why you pick it
 * if provided in description also list:
    - CPU type, number cores and generations
    - RAM size and ddr type
    - STORAGE size
    - if is suitable for running proxmox jellyfin encoding
 * IMPORTANT: include link from 'item_url' field

Structure example:

Product Name / Model (link to product)
Price: [Amount]
Reason for Selection: [Explanation]
CPU: [Processor Details]
RAM: [Memory]
Storage: [Capacity & Type]
Proxmox / Jellyfin: [Compatibility assessment]

